+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project uses Semantic Versioning (Semver) for its version numbers. Semver was chosen because it is the clearer option for what consumers of packages and libraries expect: the major, minor, and patch components explicitly signal the magnitude of a change and the compatibility expectations that come with it.
